Campus Group Buy database migrations
====================================

Run Alembic commands from the project root with the project virtual environment:

    .\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m alembic current
    .\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m alembic history
    .\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"
    .\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m alembic upgrade head

Revision 96b9bc280005 is an empty baseline for the database schema that already
existed before Alembic was introduced. It must not create or drop business tables.

Always back up backend/campus_group_buy.db before applying a new migration and
review every autogenerated revision before running upgrade.
